  "html": "\n<div align=\"center\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"630\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td height=\"10\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><a name=\"top\"></a></span></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/memo_t.gif\" height=\"25\" width=\"630\"> <p><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"24\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/u.gif\" width=\"24\">O. \n                            Combat&amp;Jobs</b></span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/memo_m.gif\" height=\"39\" width=\"630\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:60%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolordark=\"#666666\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"600\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/alpha_background_1.gif\" height=\"22\">\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" bordercolordark=\"#666666\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"590\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td background=\"/img/posts/site/skill_knowhow/images/alpha_background.gif\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font color=\"black\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_m_1/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">1써클</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> \n                                        l </font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_m_2/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">2써클</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> \n                                        l </font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_m_3/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">3써클</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> \n                                        l </font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_m_4/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">4써클</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> \n                                        l </font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_m_5/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">5써클</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> \n                                        l </font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_m_6/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">6써클</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> \n                                        l </font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_m_7/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">7써클</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> \n                                        l </font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_m_8/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">8써클</font></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"> \n                                        l&nbsp;</font><a href=\"/site/skill_index/uo_combat_m_s/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">마법책만들기와 기초운용</font></a></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-right:20; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:15;\">\n                        &nbsp;</p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#CCCCCC\" bordercolordark=\"white\" bordercolorlight=\"#CCCCCC\" cellpadding=\"5\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"560\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"left\" border=\"0\" height=\"44\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/combat/8c/summon_demon.gif\" width=\"44\">Summon \n                                        Daemon</b></span></font>\n</p><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Words of Power \n                                        : </span></font><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Kal \n                                        Vas Xen Corp&nbsp;</span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> 지속시간 \n                                        : 4 *메저리스킬 (최고 480초)</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">소요 약초 : Blood \n                                        Moss, Mandrake Root, Spider’s Silk, \n                                        Sulphurous Ash</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">설명 \n                                        : Summon Daemon는 데몬을 소환하는 마법입니다. \n                                        시전자는 약간의 카르마를 잃게 되며 소환된 \n                                        데몬을 조정할 수 있습니다. 애완동물의 \n                                        슬롯수는 4를 차지합니다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"left\" border=\"0\" height=\"44\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/combat/8c/energy_vortex.gif\" width=\"44\">Energy \n                                        Vortex</b></span></font>\n</p><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Words of Power \n                                        :</span></font><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> </span></font><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Vas \n                                        Corp Por</span></font><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">지속시간 \n                                        : 90초</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">소요 약초 : Blood \n                                        Moss, Black Pearl, Mandrake Root, Nightshade</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">설명 \n                                        : Energy Vortex은 빠르게 회전하는 소환물로 \n                                        6타일이내의 목표물중에 (메절+Int)가</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">높은 \n                                        목표물을 제 1순위로 초당 26데미지로 \n                                        공격합니다. 에너지볼텍스는 팻이 아니므로 \n                                        공격이나</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">팔로우등의 \n                                        명령에 따르지 않습니다. 컨트롤이 되지 \n                                        않기 때문에 디스펠에 대한 마법저항력이</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">높습니다. \n                                        또한 5x5타일안에 \n                                        해당 볼텍스나 블레이드스피릿이</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">연속적으로 \n                                        여러 플레이어들이 풀었을때 총 6마리까지 \n                                        마리 수 제한이 됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">해당 \n                                        소환물은 6써클 디스펠로 없앨 수 있으며 \n                                        애완동물의 슬롯수의 2을 차지하게 됩니다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"left\" border=\"0\" height=\"44\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/combat/8c/resurrection.gif\" width=\"44\">Resurrection</b></span></font>\n</p><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Words of Power \n                                        : </span></font><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">An \n                                        Corp</span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;지속시간 \n                                        : 즉시</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">소요 약초 : Blood \n                                        Moss, Garlic, Ginseng</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">설명 \n                                        &nbsp;:&nbsp;Resurrection는 죽은 플레이어를 \n                                        부활시키는 마법입니다. 애완동물의 경우는 \n                                        베네터리</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">라는 \n                                        붕대질로 살릴 수 있으며 전사의 경우는 \n                                        힐링이라는 붕대질로 살릴 수 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"left\" border=\"0\" height=\"44\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/combat/8c/summon_fire.gif\" width=\"44\">Fire \n                                        Elemental </b></span></font>\n</p><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Words of Power \n                                        : </span></font><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Kal \n                                        Vas Xen Flam&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">지속시간 \n                                        :  4 *메저리스킬 (최고 480초)</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">소요 약초 : Blood \n                                        Moss, Mandrake Root, Spider's Silk, \n                                        Sulphurous Ash</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">설명 \n                                        : Fire Elemental 은 불의 정령을 소환하는 \n                                        마법입니다. </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">애완동물의 \n                                        슬롯수는 4를 차지합니다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"left\" border=\"0\" height=\"44\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/combat/8c/summon_earth.gif\" width=\"44\">Earth \n                                        Elemental </b></span></font>\n</p><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Words of Power \n                                        : </span></font><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Kal \n                                        Vas Xen Ylem&nbsp;</span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">지속시간 \n                                        :  4 *메저리스킬 (최고 480초)</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">소요 약초 : Mandrake \n                                        Root, Blood Moss, Spider’s Silk</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">설명 \n                                        : Earth Elemental 은 땅의 정령을 소환하는 \n                                        마법입니다. </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">애완동물의 \n                                        슬롯수는 2를 차지합니다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"left\" border=\"0\" height=\"44\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/combat/8c/summon_water.gif\" width=\"44\">Water \n                                        Elemental</b></span></font>\n</p><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Words of Power \n                                        :</span></font><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> Kal \n                                        Vas Xen An Flam</span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;지속시간 \n                                        :  4 *메저리스킬 (최고 480초)</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">소요 약초 : Blood \n                                        Moss, Mandrake Root, Spider's Silk</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">설명 \n                                        : Water Elemental은 물의 정령을 소환하는 \n                                        마법입니다. </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">애완동물의 \n                                        슬롯수는 3를 차지합니다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"left\" border=\"0\" height=\"44\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/combat/8c/summon_air.gif\" width=\"44\">Air \n                                        Elemental </b></span></font>\n</p><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Words of Power \n                                        :</span></font><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> Kal \n                                        Vas Xen Hur</span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;지속시간 \n                                        : 4 *메저리스킬 (최고 480초)</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">소요 약초 : Blood \n                                        Moss, Mandrake Root, Spider's Silk</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">설명 \n                                        : Air Elemental은  공기의 정령을 소환하는 \n                                        마법입니다. </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">애완동물의 \n                                        슬롯수는 2를 차지합니다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img align=\"left\" border=\"0\" height=\"44\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill_index/images/combat/8c/earthquake.gif\" width=\"44\">EARTHQUAKE</b></span></font>\n</p><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-right:10; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Words of Power \n                                        :</span></font><font color=\"purple\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"> In \n                                        Vas Por&nbsp;</span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=